  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the addition of EAC, it's become increasingly difficult for people to get themselves out of uncomfortable situations. If you've played VRChat for any amount of time in public servers, you've most likely seen the groups of people that surround and gang up on individuals for whatever reason they deem fit. Certain flight and noclip mods allowed for quick escape from these situations, especially for people with sensory issues who get overloaded easily. Adding a per-person Personal Space, like what they did for Physbones, would greatly benefit the playerbase. \nCurrently, the Personal Space mode still allows friends to get quite close without fading them out, and blocks each and every stranger. That's a great umbrella solution, but it can get quite complicated when attempting to hide a stranger or someone on your friends list without hiding someone who's not quite bothering you. As an actor myself, sometimes my bits require me to get close to people, and the current personal space mode makes this quite difficult.\nIn conclusion, the ability to turn on personal space for specific individuals would provide a solution to most scenarios in which it would be used.",
